# Allowlist: the server image needs only the workspace manifests, the server,
# and the shared package. Everything else (the desktop app's ~1.2 GB of models
# and binaries, Rust targets, local databases) stays out of the build context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json
!apps/server/
!packages/shared/

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
